/* WolkaraForever: the app's German strings.
 *
 * Reviewed for natural, formal German suitable for an iPad interface: consistent „Sie“,
 * concise labels, German quotation marks („…“), an en dash for ranges and a space before
 * an ellipsis. Meaningful English product names stay as they are: WolkaraForever, World of
 * Warcraft, CurseForge, Mac-Ever, iPadOS, GitHub.
 *
 * Every key here must exist in en.lproj/Localizable.strings with the same conversions;
 * wolkaraforever/tools/check_localization.py enforces that in both directions.
 */

